.key VOL/A,TAG/A,ROUNDS/A
; soakfs VOL TAG ROUNDS: copy SYS:Libs to VOL:soak, hash it, delete it,
; ROUNDS times. Every round's MD5 list goes to SHARED:vscsi/soak/TAG.md5
; (appended), for tools/md5cmp.py per round on the host.
FailAt 30
Echo "start" >SHARED:vscsi/soak/<TAG>.log
Date >>SHARED:vscsi/soak/<TAG>.log
Set n 0
Lab round
Copy SYS:Libs <VOL>:soak ALL QUIET
CD <VOL>:soak
C:MD5Sum #? >>SHARED:vscsi/soak/<TAG>.md5
CD RAM:
Delete <VOL>:soak ALL QUIET FORCE >NIL:
Set n `Eval $n + 1`
If VAL $n LT <ROUNDS>
  Skip round BACK
EndIf
Echo "end after $n rounds" >>SHARED:vscsi/soak/<TAG>.log
Date >>SHARED:vscsi/soak/<TAG>.log
Echo "<TAG> done" >SHARED:vscsi/soak/<TAG>.done
